{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/618","id":5054506191,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU-xXos8AAAABLUWkzw","html_url":"https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/618","diff_url":"https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/618.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/618.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/issues/618","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/618/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/618/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/issues/618/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/statuses/84db9a0fb517ba646f7690976727696823477407","number":618,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"ds4: Pool::start fences its generation store before the sleeper load, and a worker starts from generation 0 (either could leave a batch nobody helps unrun)","user":{"login":"SeriousRising","id":69419008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDE5MDA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69419008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising","html_url":"https://github.com/SeriousRising","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #615.\n\n**What.** Two lines in `src/ds4/ds4_pool.hpp`, for the two ways a worker could sleep through a batch (#615):\n\n- `Pool::start()`: `std::atomic_thread_fence(std::memory_order_seq_cst)` between the `gen_` store and the `sleeping_` load. Without it x86 may read `sleeping_` before `gen_` is visible, and a worker going to sleep at that instant misses both the generation and the notify.\n- `loop()`: `seen = 0` (the value of `gen_` at construction) instead of `gen_.load()` when the thread first runs, so a batch `start()`ed before the thread ran is still new to it.\n\n**Test.** `tests/ds4_pool_test.cpp` gains `pool_start_wakes_sleeper`: 200000 one-job batches on a one-worker pool, `spin_us = 0`, `start()` + `wait()` and no `help()`, with a watchdog (5 s without progress fails). Build as the file's header says (`g++ -std=c++17 -O2 -pthread -I src/ds4 tests/ds4_pool_test.cpp`). 10 runs each:\n\n| `ds4_pool.hpp` | Xeon E5-2697 v4 VM (16 vCPU) | Ryzen 7 9800X3D |\n|---|---|---|\n| v1.1.35 | 10 / 10 hang | 10 / 10 hang |\n| fence only | 9 / 10 hang (all at batch 0) | 0 / 30 |\n| `seen = 0` only | 10 / 10 hang (batches 5 .. 10410) | - |\n| this PR | **0 / 10** | 0 / 30 |\n\n**Output: unchanged.** **Speed: no cost visible.** Engine on 2x CMP 170HX 64 GB (sm_80, CUDA 12.8; PCIe Gen2 x16 + Gen2 x4), 16-vCPU Xeon E5-2697 v4 VM, DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 GSQ-RCO IQ2_XXS, `--tp 1 --gpus 0,1 --dspark on --cpu-threads 14 --suffix-draft 0`, ~2240 routed experts on the CPU lane: 2000 fixed prompt ids + 256 greedy tokens give the same ids and DSpark counts as v1.1.35; decode 40.68 (v1.1.35) / 40.99 (this PR) tok/s, one run each. One `mfence` per `start()` is ~16-30 a token, a few µs of a ~26 ms token (estimate).\n\n**Checks** (as `.github/workflows/tests.yml`): `tools/check_hip_compat.py` OK; server tests 463 OK (12 skipped); installer and tools tests 584 OK (31 skipped) - the same counts as v1.1.35.\n\nNot touched: `glmfast::Workers` (`src/core/glm_fast_state.hpp:164-165`, `:202`) has the same shape; noted in #615, not tested.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-28T17:05:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T21:11:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T21:11:00Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"43893a5a0cfc93b63749ef91bca766cdac81e023","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"SeriousRising:ds4-pool-start-fence","ref":"ds4-pool-start-fence","repo":{"id":1437354424,"node_id":"R_kgDOVaxJuA","name":"project-maya","full_name":"SeriousRising/project-maya","owner":{"login":"SeriousRising","id":69419008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDE5MDA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69419008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising","html_url":"https://github.com/SeriousRising","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Project Maya - run GLM-5.3-Flash (321B MoE), DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 (748B MoE) and MiniMax-M3.1-Flash (428B MoE) privately on your own GPU(s), from one card to 16, NVIDIA or AMD, Linux or Windows. Engine, server, dashboa